<title>USA: TABLE - Intimate Brands Inc Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Intimate Brands Inc Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ohio 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>INTIMATE BRANDS, INC. and SUBSIDIARIES</p>
<p>			   SECOND QUARTER REPORT</p>
<p>			     August 2, 1997</p>
<p>The following are Intimate Brands, Inc.'s unaudited results for the thirteen weeks ended August 2, 1997 compared to the thirteen weeks ended August 3, 1996.</p>
<p>					 Thirteen Weeks Ended   Percent</p>
<p>					     Aug 2,    Aug 3,  Increase</p>
<p>					   1997	  1996</p>
<p>				 (in thousands except per share data)</p>
<p> Net Sales				  $826,574  $653,291  26.5%</p>
<p> Income Before Income Taxes	    101,698    80,160  26.9%</p>
<p> Net Income				   60,998    48,060  26.9%</p>
<p> Earnings Per Share			   0.24	0.19  26.3%</p>
<p>Weighted Average</p>
<p>   Shares Outstanding		    253,271   253,114     --</p>
<p>The following are Intimate Brands, Inc.'s unaudited results for the</p>
<p>twenty-six weeks ended August 2, 1997 compared to the twenty-six weeks</p>
<p>ended August 3, 1996.</p>
<p>				    Twenty-six Weeks Ended    Percent</p>
